---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Governance & GRC Learning Resources & Toolkits | RKMIDIGILABS"
  description="Free practitioner toolkits, ISO 42001 checklists, EU AI Act decision trees, FRIA templates, and LLM security guides for GRC and cybersecurity professionals."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0b1a33] via-[#112649] to-[#071326] text-white py-16 lg:py-24 border-b border-[#1d3d75] overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_70%_20%,rgba(16,185,129,0.12),transparent_60%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Practitioner Knowledge Hub
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight text-white">
          AI Governance & GRC <span class="text-emerald-400">Learning Resources</span> & Toolkits
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Accelerate your compliance and governance operations. Download audit-tested templates, gap analysis matrices, regulatory decision trees, and LLM security checklists crafted by senior practitioners.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href="#toolkits" 
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-[#16A34A] hover:bg-[#15803D] text-white shadow-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Browse Downloadable Toolkits</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a 
            href="#glossary" 
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-[#1a3869] hover:bg-[#254d93] text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Explore AI Governance Glossary</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Downloadable Toolkits -->
  <section id="toolkits" class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#16A34A] mb-2">Audit-Ready Toolkits</h2>
        <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-black">
          Essential Templates for Compliance & Security Teams
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Free, customizable resources engineered to save hundreds of hours in policy authoring, vendor evaluations, and regulatory gap assessments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Toolkit 1 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">PDF & Flowchart</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-black mt-3">
              EU AI Act High-Risk Classification Decision Tree
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Step-by-step logic map for determining whether your algorithmic systems fall under Prohibited (Art. 5), High-Risk (Annex I & III), or General Purpose AI (GPAI) obligations.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Request%20Download:%20EU%20AI%20Act%20Classification%20Tree"
              class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"/></svg>
              <span>Request Free PDF Copy</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Toolkit 2 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Spreadsheet / Excel</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-black mt-3">
              ISO/IEC 42001:2023 Readiness & Gap Analysis Checklist
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Complete Clause 4–10 compliance tracker combined with Annex A 38 control verification matrices to assess organizational maturity ahead of third-party certification.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Request%20Download:%20ISO%2042001%20Gap%20Checklist"
              class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"/></svg>
              <span>Request Checklist Sheet</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Toolkit 3 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 text-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-700 bg-purple-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Word / Markdown</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-black mt-3">
              Fundamental Rights Impact Assessment (FRIA) Starter Template
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Standardized Article 27 FRIA questionnaire designed for deployers of high-risk AI in banking, HR/recruitment, critical infrastructure, and biometric verification.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Request%20Download:%20FRIA%20Template"
              class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"/></svg>
              <span>Request Template Package</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Toolkit 4 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Policy Doc</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-black mt-3">
              Enterprise Generative AI Acceptable Use Policy
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Definitive corporate policy document establishing employee rules for ChatGPT, Claude, GitHub Copilot, protecting confidential IP, and managing corporate data confidentiality.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Request%20Download:%20GenAI%20Corporate%20Policy"
              class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"/></svg>
              <span>Request Policy Template</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Toolkit 5 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-red-700 bg-red-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Security Matrix</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-black mt-3">
              OWASP Top 10 for LLMs Vulnerability Matrix
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Security tester reference covering direct & indirect prompt injection payloads, system prompt extraction, training data poisoning, and remediation guardrail patterns.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Request%20Download:%20OWASP%20LLM%20Matrix"
              class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"/></svg>
              <span>Request Security Guide</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Toolkit 6 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-teal-50 text-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-teal-700 bg-teal-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Vendor Due Diligence</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-black mt-3">
              Third-Party AI Vendor Diligence Questionnaire
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              45 rigorous security and compliance questions assessing foundational LLM providers on model training data rights, zero-retention API policies, and SOC 2 Type II controls.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Request%20Download:%20AI%20Vendor%20Questionnaire"
              class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"/></svg>
              <span>Request Vendor Questionnaire</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Glossary Section -->
  <section id="glossary" class="py-16 bg-slate-50 border-t border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#16A34A] mb-2">Essential Terminology</h2>
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black">
          The AI Governance & Cyber Risk Lexicon
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-base font-black text-black font-mono">AIGP (Artificial Intelligence Governance Professional)</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            The premier global professional credential issued by the IAPP establishing practitioner competence across AI foundations, safety ethics, regulatory compliance, and governance program management.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-base font-black text-black font-mono">AIMS (Artificial Intelligence Management System)</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            The systematic organizational framework standardized under ISO/IEC 42001 that integrates policies, risk appetite, operational controls, and continuous evaluation across all AI applications.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-base font-black text-black font-mono">FRIA (Fundamental Rights Impact Assessment)</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            A mandatory assessment mandated by Article 27 of the EU AI Act requiring deployers of high-risk AI to evaluate potential harms to fundamental human rights, non-discrimination, and privacy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-base font-black text-black font-mono">C2PA (Coalition for Content Provenance and Authenticity)</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            An open technical standard providing cryptographically verifiable metadata manifests embedded directly within synthetic media, complying with EU AI Act Article 50 watermarking mandates.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-base font-black text-black font-mono">TPRM (Third-Party Risk Management)</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            The continuous discipline of assessing, auditing, and mitigating cybersecurity, operational, and privacy vulnerabilities introduced by external SaaS providers, cloud hosts, and AI model vendors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-base font-black text-black font-mono">Indirect Prompt Injection</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            An attack vector where an LLM processes external, untrusted data (e.g. web pages, emails, database records) containing adversarial hidden instructions that hijack model behavior without user awareness.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Box -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#112649] to-[#071326] p-8 sm:p-12 text-white text-center shadow-xl border border-[#1d3d75]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white">
          Need a Custom Compliance Toolkit or Enterprise Policy Review?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Contact our advisory team for tailored templates matching your specific cloud environment, model registry, and audit requirements.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Custom%20Toolkit%20Inquiry" 
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-[#16A34A] hover:bg-[#15803D] text-white shadow-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Email: rkmvedant@gmail.com</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/919371650121?text=Hi%20RKMIDIGILABS,%20I%20would%20like%20to%20request%20an%20AI%20Governance%20toolkit." 
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/20 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>WhatsApp: +91 9371650121</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
